<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal June number/unemployed fell yr/yr 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal June number/unemployed fell yr/yr 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Portugal fell a year-on-year 6.5 percent in June and was down 3.7 percent compared with the previous month, the Institute for Employment and Professional Training (IEFP) said.</p>
<p>					June 1997  May 1997  June 1996</p>
<p> Registered unemployed	    435,048   451,761    465,347</p>
<p>NOTE- The IEFP does not provide unemployment data expressed as a percentage of the total workforce.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
